        "Content": "SEMI-DETACHED DUPLEX APARTMENT - 3 BEDS - 2 BATH - ONLY 1 REMAINING!!!\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property are delighted to bring to the market this exceptional A-Rated 3 Bedroom Duplex Homes, ideal for First-Time Buyers and a smart alternative to renting. This property is situated in the New Development Clos Emer, Saltown, Dundalk. Perfect for First Time Buyers. This Property will be presented : Painted, Tiled and all New Floor Covering included. Completely Turn Key and ready to move into. This A Rated Home is economical to run and will result in ongoing savings with energy bills. Located on a bus route making it easy for access to all local services and facilities. Qualify for Help To Buy Scheme up to maximum of 10% of the Purchase Price ( subject to Revenue t & c's ). Guide Prices - 3 Bed Duplex €305,000.\r\n\r\nFor all further inquiries, Contact Blue Sky Property 042-9329333 or log on to www.closemer.com.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
